1. Get form response details

Use Get Response Details Get response details for the "Crypto Tutoring Services Form."

Extract the following fields

Student Name

Student Email Address

Selected Topic (Copilot Studio, LinkedIn Optimization, Soft Skills, AI Programming)

Additional Information.

2. Retrieve the corresponding tutor from the Tutor Directory

Use List rows present in a table to retrieve all rows from the Tutor Directory table

where Topic equals the "Selected Topic from the form response.

(If multiple tutors match, select the first row or the row that meets your preferred rule.)

3. Draft an email message to the assigned tutor

Using Draft an email message Draft an email message to notify the tutor of the new request.

Example Email:

Hi [TutorName].

A new tutoring request has been assigned to you.

Student Name: [StudentName]

Student Email: [StudentEmail]

Topic: [TopicOrChapter)

Summary: [ShortDescription)

Please reach out to the student to schedule the session.

-Crypto Tutoring Intake Agent

4. Run "Send a draft message"

Using Send a Draft message to send the drafted message to the tutor using the dynamic content from Step 3.

5. Use Add a row into a table to dynamically fill in:

Customer Name with the Name field from the form

Phone Number with the phone number field from the form

Email Address from the Email address from the form

Topic from the Topic selected on the form

Additional Information from the Description field from the form

Assigned Tutor Name from the TutorName from the Tutor Directory
